  "content_html": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/687ee83b9e83277d1d.gif\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"אשכול של ענבים וערוץ נחל\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"186\" data-original-width=\"361\" height=\"192\" src=\"/assets/images/content/687ee83b9e83277d1d.gif\" width=\"372\" /></a></div></span></h1><h1></h1><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><a></a></span><p></p><div><div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">תמונה טמונה</span></h2></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זַהוּ בתמונת הפוסט, את שם המקום המוזכר בפרשה.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מפה טמונה</span></h2></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">זַהוּ במפה, 4 רחובות המוזכרים בפרשה.</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/bae96d07f7a62f1616.gif\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"730\" data-original-width=\"922\" height=\"316\" src=\"/assets/images/content/bae96d07f7a62f1616.gif\" width=\"400\" /></a></div><br /><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">חידת בונוס</span></h2></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הצביעו על הטעות בתמונת הנושא של מדור \"<a href=\"https://www.parasha-week.co.il/2025/06/shelach-midrash.html\">בית המדרש 👈 לפרשת שלח</a>\"&nbsp;</span>(רמז \"הליכת ירח\")</div><div><br /></div></span></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מדרגאות</span></h2></div><div><h3><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><span>🔲</span><span>🔲 צאצא</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><span>🔲</span><span>🔲</span><span>🔲 דִּיאָלֵקְט/עָגָה</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><span>🔲</span><span>🔲</span><span>🔲</span><span>🔲 מתמצא בנושא</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><span>🔲</span><span>🔲</span><span>🔲</span><span>🔲</span><span>🔲 פרי (מהפרשה)&nbsp;</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><span>🔲</span><span>🔲</span><span>🔲</span><span>🔲 גורם עונג</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><span></span><span>🔲</span><span>🔲</span><span>🔲 כתובת</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><span></span><span>🔲</span><span>🔲 אומה</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"><br /></span></p></h3><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></h2><h3 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👈&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">תמונה טמונה:</span></span></h3><h3><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">\"נחל אשכול\"</span></div></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👈 מפה</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;טמונה:</span></span></h3><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">1. רחוב נחל אשכול (\"למקום ההוא קרא נחל אשכול\"),</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">2. רחוב מעלות חברון (\"ויבא עד חברון\"),</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">3. שדרות כלב בן יפונה (\"למטה יהודה כלב בן יפונה\"),</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">4. רחוב יהושע בן נון (\"למטה אפרים הושע בן נון\").</span></div><div><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👈&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">חידת בונוס:</span></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">חפירת הקברים נעשתה לקראת ליל ט' באב, אך הירח המלא מייצג את ט\"ו באב...</span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👈&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מדרגאות:</span></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\"></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-weight: normal;\">בן, ניב, מבין, ענבים, נעים, מען, עם</span></h3></div>"
}
